ck).\r\n 2979:         # Every REGISTERED style (and the dynamic visual_storybased style) is valid.\r\n 2980:         if visual_style != _ROLLS.DYNAMIC_STYLE_ID:\r\n 2981:             _otr_visual_styles.resolve_visual_style(visual_style)\r\n 2982:         # The lane REQUEST GATE (2026-07-31) was removed 2026-08-14 with the\r\n 2983:         # word authority. It sat here to let a dispatched lane refuse a\r\n 2984:         # `target_words` outside its band -- one since-retired lane's\r\n 2985:         # 30..900 was the only band ever declared. There is no target to\r\n 2986:         # refuse, so there is nothing to gate: the act count is always\r\n 2987:         # honoured, and every bank's topology accepts every act count.\r\n 2988:         # Story-scaffold UI toggle (2026-06-24) -- resolve the widget into the\r\n 2989:         # process env FIRST, before generate_outline + every style-grammar read,\r\n 2990:         # so this single control governs the whole bundled scaffold: the style\r\n 2991:         # grammar + the KILL-1 body-output gate (via\r\n 2992:         # _otr_config.style_grammar_enabled) AND the outline announcer-close gate\r\n 2993:         # (which reads OTR_ENABLE_STYLE_GRAMMAR directly). \"on\"/\"off\" override the\r\n 2994:         # env for THIS run; \"auto\" restores the import-time baseline so an on/off\r\n 2995:         # run never leaks to the next prompt in a long-lived server. A local\r\n 2996:         # `import os` binds the name first -- run() has a later function-local\r\n 2997:         # `import os`, which makes os function-local for the whole body (the\r\n 2998:         # 096ef64 UnboundLocalError gotcha).\r\n 2999:         # LLM slot preflight (GGUF row registry, 2026-07-16): the single early\r\n 3000:         # resolution of the ONE policy + normalized slot ids + immutable\r\n 3001:         # per-slot GGUF load_config -- AFTER the bank / word-count / refine\r\n 3002:         # gates, BEFORE the scaffold env mutation and any source fe