coverage_plan.segment_render_window` authority.\r\nnodes/otr_shot_lock.py:2083:    shot[\"coverage_plan\"] = plan.to_dict()\r\nnodes/otr_shot_lock.py:2086:    # ``render_driver.assert_coverage_plans`` re-derives this with the same\r\nnodes/otr_shot_lock.py:2627:    #: every ``_stamp_coverage_plan`` call. For the engines in\r\nnodes/otr_shot_lock.py:2628:    #: ``frame_contract.PLANNING_CAP_ENGINES`` it narrows what the partitioner\r\nnodes/otr_shot_lock.py:2759:        # the call below, because ``_stamp_coverage_plan`` returns early for a\r\nnodes/otr_shot_lock.py:2780:        _stamp_coverage_plan(shots[-1], b[\"beat_id\"],\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
